================================================================================
TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

If build fails:
  1. Check CMake version (cmake --version)
  2. Verify dependencies installed
  3. Try clean build (rm -rf build/*)
  4. Check compiler supports C++17

If runtime fails:
  1. Check OpenGL drivers installed
  2. Verify SDL2 runtime libraries present
  3. Run with --verbose flag
  4. Check console for error messages

Common issues:
  - "SDL2 not found"     → Install libsdl2-dev
  - "OpenGL not found"   → Install mesa drivers
  - "GLM not found"      → Install libglm-dev
  - Linking errors       → Clean build directory

